# Marfan syndrome external news feed source package (pipe-delimited)
#
# These sources are separate from the Marfan condition pack because their
# publisher permissions are restrictive, work-specific, unverified, or involve
# an intermediary index. Every source is disabled by default. Installing this
# package requires acceptance of Health Signal's external news feed sources
# agreement. Review the current publisher terms before enabling a source.
#
# Health Signal displays headline, date, publisher attribution and an outbound
# link only for these rows. It does not reproduce article bodies or images.
#
source_id|name|endpoint|category|feed_kind|enabled_by_default|publisher|classification|reviewed|fields_displayed|permission|commercial_use|attribution|terms_url|rights_or_corrections_contact|notes
medlineplus-marfan|MedlinePlus · Marfan Syndrome|https://medlineplus.gov/feeds/topics/marfansyndrome.xml|Research|headlineOnly|false|MedlinePlus / U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official topic RSS with restricted reuse|30 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|MedlinePlus RSS feeds are for personal use only. Health Signal uses this feed only in the user's personal, on-device feed reader; no broad website or information-service redistribution is performed.|Personal use only; no commercial or broad information-service redistribution.|Credit MedlinePlus and the U.S. National Library of Medicine and link to the original page|https://medlineplus.gov/about/using/usingcontent/|https://medlineplus.gov/about/contactus.html|Verified topic RSS endpoint. Personal, on-device feed-reader use only; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
